				<r3d:description language="eng">Bharat Genome Database (BGDB) is an open-access resource dedicated to the genomic data of plant and animal species native to India. The database provides curated genome assemblies, functional annotations, and integrated bioinformatics tools including JBrowse1, JBrowse2, and BLAST. BGDB supports research, education, and training in genomics by promoting biodiversity studies, comparative genomics, and capacity building for students and researchers in India and worldwide.</r3d:description>
